# Production worker configuration (set via `npx wrangler secret put` /
# Cloudflare dashboard, NOT a committed file).
#
# HYPERDRIVE binding "HYPERDRIVE" is declared in wrangler.jsonc (prod path).
# Without it (fallback), the worker needs:
#   HEROKU_API_TOKEN / HEROKU_APP_NAME — resolves DATABASE_URL live from the
#   Heroku Platform API (5-min cache; invalidate+retry on credential errors).
#   DATABASE_SSL / DB_URL_TTL_MS       — see .dev.vars.example.
#   APP_SECRET                         — internal unseal key (match backend).
#
# AI throttle (Layerbase Redis REST; Upstash-compatible names accepted):
#   UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL / UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN (or REDIS_REST_*)
#   AI_RATE_LIMIT_MAX / AI_RATE_LIMIT_WINDOW_MS / AI_RATE_LIMIT_DISABLED
